    <entry>
        <title>Eat &amp; Run</title>
        <author>
            <name>Kevin Kwilinski</name>
        </author>
        <link href="https://skylarkfoundry.github.io/poetry/eat-and-run.html"/>
        <id>https://skylarkfoundry.github.io/poetry/eat-and-run.html</id>
        <media:content url="https://skylarkfoundry.github.io/poetry/media/posts/7/cute-fluffy-little-birds-huddle-together-in-winter-while-its-snowing-by-stewart-edmondson-and-alexan.jpg.webp" medium="image" />

        <updated>2026-09-28T19:34:51-04:00</updated>
            <summary type="html">
                <![CDATA[
                        <img src="https://skylarkfoundry.github.io/poetry/media/posts/7/cute-fluffy-little-birds-huddle-together-in-winter-while-its-snowing-by-stewart-edmondson-and-alexan.jpg.webp" alt="" />
                    Birds at the feeder, when twenty below, come and leave quickly and&hellip;
                ]]>
            </summary>
        <content type="html">
            <![CDATA[
                    <p><img src="https://skylarkfoundry.github.io/poetry/media/posts/7/cute-fluffy-little-birds-huddle-together-in-winter-while-its-snowing-by-stewart-edmondson-and-alexan.jpg.webp" class="type:primaryImage" alt="" /></p>
                <div class="align-center">Birds at the feeder,<br>when twenty below,<br>come and leave quickly<br>and make quite a show.</div>
<div class="align-center"> </div>
<div class="align-center">And when they fly off<br>to where do they go,<br>to some secret lair<br>protected from snow?</div>
<div class="align-center"> </div>
<div class="align-center">Are they taking turns<br>when they come to eat,<br>the rest of them back,<br>preserving the heat?</div>
<div class="align-center"> </div>
<div class="align-center">Birds of a feather,<br>as everyone’s told,<br>they stick together<br>to survive such cold.</div>
            ]]>
        </content>
    </entry>
