                    Sometimes I wonder if I am the father of Leibowitz. If my&hellip;
                ]]>
            </summary>
        <content type="html">
            <![CDATA[
                    <p><img src="https://skylarkfoundry.github.io/poetry/media/posts/6/Michaud-A-Canticle-for-Leibowitz.jpg.webp" class="type:primaryImage" alt="" /></p>
                <div class="align-center">Sometimes I wonder<br>if I am the father of Leibowitz.<br>If my son is destined,<br>to be the last.<br>A mistaken saint,<br>before a thousand years<br>of relearning lessons from<br>the past.</div>
<div class="align-center"> </div>
<div class="align-center">Sometimes I wonder<br>if there was anything I<br>might have done to prevent<br>the Flame Deluge.<br>Maybe becoming a true saint,<br>by loving more and caring for<br>the feeble Pope’s children<br>next door?</div>
            ]]>
        </content>
